  "translation": "Gomme Dafida a kwa gore Nabale o hwetše, gomme a re: A a thankwe Yahwe yo a lweditšeng ⟨את⟩ kgetsi ya tlaišo ya ka go seatla sa Nabale, gomme o ile a hwetša mohlanka wa gage go tšwa mpego; gomme bohweši bja Nabale Yahwe o bo bušetše mogologolo wa gagwe. Gomme Dafida a romela ba bolela le Abigale, go mo tšerela gore a be mosadi wa gagwe.",
